@startuml bp2-maintain-profile
!include style.iuml
title BP2 Maintain Company Profile\n(US1-4 to US1-12, US1-6, US2-1 to US2-4)

|Company|
start
:Open own profile;

|MangoDB System|
:Show company information
and mark missing fields;

|Company|
switch (What to maintain?)
case (Company information)
  :Edit company information;
case (Portfolio\n[Provider])
  :Add, edit, or delete
  portfolio item;
case (Certificate\n[Provider])
  :Add, edit, or delete
  certificate with file;
case (Service listing\n[Provider])
  :Create, edit, or delete
  service listing;
case (Account)
  :Request account deletion;
endswitch

|MangoDB System|
:Check data and ownership;
if (Valid, owned by the company,\nand no blocking project?) then (yes)
  :Save change;
  :Company Profile
  <U+005B>Updated<U+005D>]
  :Show latest information;
else (no)
  :Reject change and
  show the reason;
endif

|Company|
:Review profile;
stop

note right
  Blocking project rules:
  - a service linked to a project cannot be deleted (US2-4)
  - an account with a project in progress cannot be deleted (US1-6)
  A deleted account cannot log in, but its project
  history stays for other companies.
end note
@enduml
